  "notes": "Item 19 presents data on a per-franchisee basis (not per territory). Revenue data (Collected Gross Revenue) is based on 115 franchisees operating 198 territories during the full 2023 calendar year. Cost data is based on a subset of 70 franchisees operating 128 territories. Data is segmented into 4 tables by number of territories operated per franchisee: 1, 2, 3, and 4-7. Each table shows Collected Gross Revenue broken into performance quartiles (Top/Bottom 25%, 50%, 75%) plus a Total row, and Cost of Materials, Cost of Hourly Workers and Subcontractors, and Cost of Salaried Staff as % of Collected Gross Revenue. Figures do not include royalties, advertising/marketing fees, payroll, vehicle costs, insurance, telephone, utilities, depreciation, amortization, or taxes. The cost metrics (Cost of Materials, Cost of Hourly Workers and Subcontractors, Cost of Salaried Staff) are expressed as percentages and do not include owner/franchisee salaries or distributions."
